OL,3,AMen jailed for 'serious incident'
OL,4,Aoutside airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men who carried out a serious
OL,7,Fattack outside Bristol Airport that
OL,8,Fholidaymakers thought was an "act of
OL,9,Fterror" have been jailed, police said.
OL,11,FVladamir Stan, 52, Able Marin, 21,
OL,12,FFlorin Stan, 28, Constantin Stan, 29,
OL,13,Fand Emanuel-Ronaldo Dumitru, 27,
OL,14,Fassaulted two men with bats after
OL,15,Fcrashing into them on 21 February.
OL,17,FThe men pleaded guilty to violent
OL,18,Fdisorder at Bristol Crown Court on 28
OL,19,FAugust and were jailed for a combined
OL,20,F16 years and 10 months.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
