OL,3,AMen jailed for 'serious incident'
OL,4,Aoutside airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Con Charlotte Couch, from Avon and
OL,7,FSomerset Police, said: "We understand
OL,8,Fthe immense fear this incident caused,
OL,9,Fwith witnesses believing at the time
OL,10,Fthis was an active act of terror."
